settings.panascais_caves:random_sounds.sound_volume=Sound Volume
settings.panascais_caves:random_sounds.sound_volume_explanation=§7Controls the volume of random cave sounds.
settings.panascais_caves:random_sounds.sound_volume_tooltip=§oVolume changes take effect after a few seconds.
settings.panascais_caves:random_sounds.toggle_caves=Toggle Sounds for Caves:
settings.panascais_caves:dynamic_light.title=Luz dinamica
settings.panascais_caves:dynamic_light.explanation=§7The dynamic light system allows certain items, armors, and blocks to emit light when held or worn. Use these toggles to customize which sources can emit light.
settings.panascais_caves:dynamic_light.vanilla=Vanilla
settings.panascais_caves:dynamic_light.vanilla_tooltip=Toggles dynamic light for items, armors & blocks from vanilla Minecraft.
settings.panascais_caves:dynamic_light.caves=Eternal Caves
settings.panascais_caves:dynamic_light.caves_tooltip=Toggles dynamic light for items, armors & blocks from Eternal Caves.
settings.panascais_caves:dynamic_light.other=Other Add-Ons
settings.panascais_caves:dynamic_light.other_tooltip=Toggles dynamic light for items, armors & blocks from other add-ons that have integrated support for Eternal Caves' dynamic light system.
