settings.panascais_caves:spawning.spawn_quantity_explanation=§7Controls the maximum spawn amount of custom cave mobs. Vanilla mob spawning remains unchanged.
settings.panascais_caves:spawning.spawn_quantity_tooltip=0 = No custom cave mobs\n100 = Default spawn amount\n200 = Double spawn amount
